00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:07.149
. There's a very interesting axios report
that shows our friend Bernie Sanders understands

00:00:07.149 --> 00:00:13.760
they can't count on Republicans for a damn
thing and that he plans to push covid relief

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.590
and maybe more through the Senate with a simple
majority.

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:23.680
He was on CNN's State of the Union yesterday
talking about this, and he said they'll see

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:29.650
about other issues with the covid relief package
proposed by Joe Biden, which will top up the

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:35.020
600 dollar payments to 2000 with an additional
fourteen hundred dollars and expand unemployment

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.210
