00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:42.329
Bernie Sanders says it will be a simple majority
vote in the Senate to get it through.

00:00:42.329 --> 00:00:44.760
Why is this so important?

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:51.220
This process, known as budget reconciliation,
allows Democrats to skip or circumvent the

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:58.130
60 vote requirement that exists in the Senate
for many, many legislative attempts, for many

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.510
bills.

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:06.020
And if Democrats are able to use budget reconciliation
to rather than need 60 votes in the Senate,

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:11.409
which means you've got to find 10 Republican
votes, 50 with Kamala Harris is a tie breaking

00:01:11.409 --> 00:01:18.229
vote would be enough to get benefits to unemployed
Americans to bolster unemployment benefits

00:01:18.229 --> 00:01:21.380
to get that additional fourteen hundred dollar
payment.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:25.299
And what Bernie Sanders is saying is really
clear, really pragmatic.

00:01:25.299 --> 00:01:26.750
And I love to see him saying this.

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:33.409
Bernie says, quote, What we cannot do is wait
weeks and weeks and months to go forward.

00:01:33.409 --> 00:01:34.420
We have to act now.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:37.859
We are going to use reconciliation.

00:01:37.859 --> 00:01:43.219
That's 50 votes in the Senate, plus the vice
president to pass this legislation.

00:01:43.219 --> 00:01:49.340
And when he was asked if he wants a relief
bill passed before Trump's impeachment trial

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:54.259
begins in just a couple of weeks, he said,
we've got to do everything.

00:01:54.259 --> 00:02:00.759
This is not you don't have time to sit around
weeks on impeachment and not get vaccines

00:02:00.759 --> 00:02:07.249
into the arms of people, referring, of course,
to the additional vaccine funding in the coronavirus

00:02:07.249 --> 00:02:08.249
stimulus.

00:02:08.249 --> 00:02:10.810
I think that this is absolutely the right
thing to do.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:11.950
You don't have to.

